       
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BANKREC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-CUSTOMER-RECORD.
          05 WS-RAW-DATA PIC X(33).

       01 WS-CUSTOMER-DETAILS REDEFINES
          WS-CUSTOMER-RECORD.
          05 WS-ACCOUNT-NO PIC X(10).
          05 WS-CUSTOMER-NAME PIC X(20).
          05 WS-STATUS PIC X(3).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           DISPLAY "ENTER ACCOUNT NUMBER (10 CHARACTERS):"
           ACCEPT WS-ACCOUNT-NO
           DISPLAY "ENTER CUSTOMER NAME (20 CHARACTERS):"
           ACCEPT WS-CUSTOMER-NAME
           DISPLAY "ENTER STATUS (ACT/INA/BLK):"
           ACCEPT WS-STATUS
           DISPLAY "CUSTOMER RECORD DETAILS"
           DISPLAY "RAW RECORD: " WS-RAW-DATA
           DISPLAY "ACCOUNT NUMBER: " WS-ACCOUNT-NO
           DISPLAY "CUSTOMER NAME: "
                   FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CUSTOMER-NAME)
           DISPLAY "ACCOUNT STATUS: " WS-STATUS
           EVALUATE WS-STATUS
               WHEN "ACT"
                   DISPLAY "ACCOUNT IS ACTIVE"
               WHEN "INA"
                   DISPLAY "ACCOUNT IS INACTIVE"
               WHEN "BLK"
                   DISPLAY "ACCOUNT IS BLOCKED"
               WHEN OTHER
                   DISPLAY "INVALID ACCOUNT STATUS"
           END-EVALUATE
           STOP RUN.